{"title":"Kaizen Agent Operations","schemaVersion":39,"version":1,"panels":[{"id":1,"type":"timeseries","title":"Completed workflows / second","gridPos":{"x":0,"y":0,"w":12,"h":8},"targets":[{"expr":"sum by (kind) (rate(platform_workflows_completed_total[5m]))","refId":"A"}]},{"id":2,"type":"timeseries","title":"Agent latency p95 (seconds)","gridPos":{"x":12,"y":0,"w":12,"h":8},"targets":[{"expr":"histogram_quantile(0.95,sum by (le,agent) (rate(platform_agent_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))","refId":"A"}]},{"id":3,"type":"timeseries","title":"Workflow failures","gridPos":{"x":0,"y":8,"w":12,"h":8},"targets":[{"expr":"sum by (reason) (increase(platform_workflow_failures_total[5m]))","refId":"A"}]}]}